{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36648","headline":"隐尝在江陵忝故中令白公叨蒙知遇今复重过渚宫感事悲身遂成长句 · 罗隐","name":"隐尝在江陵忝故中令白公叨蒙知遇今复重过渚宫感事悲身遂成长句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"往岁酇侯镇渚宫，曾将清律暖孤蓬。\n才怜曼倩三冬後，艺许由基一箭中。\n言重不能轻薄命，地寒终是泣春风。\n凤凰池涸台星拆，回首岐山忆至公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36648.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36648","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}